 "items": [
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "su_S1_s1097",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1097,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[surprised, bright] 东坡先生？您怎么在买骨头？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cheerful, conspiratorial, leaning in] 惠州一天只杀一只羊，肉，得让给当官的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[puzzled] 您不也是官吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[laughing at himself] 我是被贬来的官。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[delighted, like showing off treasure] 你看，骨头缝里，还有肉！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
