  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "su_S2_s1097",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1097,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[proud, demonstrating step by step] 煮熟，泡酒，撒盐，烤到微焦。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[blissful] 慢慢剔，能啃一整天，跟吃螃蟹一样。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 那啃完的骨头，给狗吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[mock-sorry, deadpan] 啃得这么干净，狗都不高兴。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to camera, laughing] 大文豪，跟狗抢饭吃。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[beaming] 我自己盖的房子。一家人，总算团聚了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 您被贬过几次了？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[counting on his fingers, cheerful] 黄州一次，惠州一次。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[shrugging, light] 黄州那次，是因为写诗，坐了四个多月牢。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[fond, remembering] 黄州猪肉便宜，有钱人不吃，穷人不会煮。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[savouring every word] 少放水，小火慢炖，火候到了，自然就香。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[excited] 这就是东坡肉！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[amused, correcting her] 东坡，是我在黄州种地的那块坡。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
