  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "su_S3_s1097",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1097,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[amazed] “日啖荔枝三百颗”，真的假的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[mock-solemn, then a wink] 诗嘛，要夸张一点。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan] 一点。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sincere] 被贬到这么远，您不难过吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[content, meaning it] 有荔枝吃，在这儿待一辈子都行。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 最近写新诗了吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[drowsy, pleased with himself, reciting] 报道先生春睡美，道人轻打五更钟。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to camera, translating] 意思是：我在这儿，睡得可香了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
