  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "su_S4_s1097",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1097,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[loud, formal, reading] 苏轼，责授琼州别驾，昌化军安置！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "ad2273ea41c989cb52eba0a9f9eeb40260f159286d4cf6824985dd5fb2c0de11",
      "voice_id": "2I36mEahS1u7ZnTKUoaB",
      "name": "Lao Dao"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[lost] 穹州……是哪儿？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stunned] 海南。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "0e6727b7d53597ce7629413dbe71eba6c1e077ca3309013a30a82e9d5230317b",
      "voice_id": "EttSxNTvxX50EUdRPQQl",
      "name": "Jordan Li"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stunned, then genuinely curious] 海南，有什么好吃的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to camera, stunned, half laughing] 被贬到天边，他第一句问吃的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "su_S4_s1101",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1101,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[loud, formal, reading] 苏轼，责授琼州别驾，昌化军安置！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "ad2273ea41c989cb52eba0a9f9eeb40260f159286d4cf6824985dd5fb2c0de11",
      "voice_id": "2I36mEahS1u7ZnTKUoaB",
      "name": "Lao Dao"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[lost] 穹州……是哪儿？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stunned] 海南。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "0e6727b7d53597ce7629413dbe71eba6c1e077ca3309013a30a82e9d5230317b",
      "voice_id": "EttSxNTvxX50EUdRPQQl",
      "name": "Jordan Li"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stunned, then genuinely curious] 海南，有什么好吃的？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to camera, stunned, half laughing] 被贬到天边，他第一句问吃的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "su_S5_s1097",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1097,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[hesitant] 家里人，不跟您去吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[matter-of-fact, kind] 只带小儿子。房子盖好了，给他们住。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[curious] 您在写什么？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[breezy, like reading out a to-do list] 安排一下。到了海南，第一件事，做棺材。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[shocked] 啊？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[same breezy tone] 第二件事，做坟。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[scared to ask] 第三件呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[grinning] 找吃的。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to camera, trying to laugh and not managing] 他笑着写的。他觉得，自己回不来了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
