  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "su_S6_s1097",
   "lang": "zh",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1097,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[playful, a riddle] 你猜，我这肚子里装的是什么？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[guessing] 学问？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[shaking his head] 不对。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[guessing again] 文章？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smiling, shaking his head] 也不对。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[fond, remembering] 只有她猜对了。她说，是一肚子不合时宜。[laughs]",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[careful] 她是……？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[plain] 朝云。家里人都散了，只有她，跟我来了惠州。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[steady, then cracking] 去年夏天，她病死在这儿。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[to the grave, gentle, breaking] 明天，我去海南。这一回，带不走你了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[smiling through it, warm] 走吧，明早还要赶路。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "c743e7cedaa9a7794b5da030508bf2397fb3cb091d3375652cdd776bf0443d71",
      "voice_id": "YGeNjTKY1wBaKygyl4y8",
      "name": "Gavin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
